    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n64517" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάθ-ησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαθεῖν</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the act of learning, getting of
